  "measure_id": "016",
  "title": "Store projections directly in head layout",
  "status": "rejected",
  "reason": "The nine-clip Q4_K screen reduced paired median request latency by 2.786%. On 30 clips the reduction was 0.316% with 17 faster inputs, while p90 rose from 129.65 to 130.44 ms and p99 from 150.98 to 151.18 ms. All 650 Q4_K transcriptions and their public token and segment fields matched. The full request benefit was too small to adopt the prototype.",
  "checks": [
